      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BLACKBRUSH ROSE (3) has an honest record despite remaining a maiden and overdue for a win, having placed seven of 25 career runs. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. GREEDY BUTCHER (2) was sent out long odds last time but charged out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 2.75 lengths fourth (30.21) over 515m at Launceston. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. TIMELESS GRACIE (8) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only a nose from the winner Tah Joe in second(19.95) at this track. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts. Expected to be in this for a long way. BONNEVILLE (7) was in the money last start and likely to feature again.",
